  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Country programme for inclusive and sustainable industrial development 2021 # 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Industry (MoI) of Indonesia has officially requested UNIDO to develop a new Country Programme 2021-2025 on August 10, 2020, building on the previous CP cycles in the country. The new CP cycle will thus continue supporting ISID in the country, targeting the intertwined challenges of enhancing the quantity and quality of export, protecting at the same time the environment and addressing the negative impacts of climate change, in a country that due to its archipelagic geography is naturally prone to natural disasters</narrative>
  </description>
